<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Afmin to change name to Awande Holdings.</title>
<headline>Afmin to change name to Awande Holdings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Afmin Holdings Ltd said on Friday it would change its name to Awande Holdings and consolidate its issued shares on the basis of one consolidated share for every 500 shares with effect from October 4.</p>
<p>The group also said it was evaluating the feasibility of disposing of its Namibian assets.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
